      "title": "Geetanjali Trading And Investments Private Limited proposed to acquire remaining 30.89% stake in Hitech Corporation Limited (BSE:526217) for INR 1.1 billion.",
      "body": "Geetanjali Trading And Investments Private Limited proposed to acquire remaining 30.89% stake in Hitech Corporation Limited (BSE:526217) for INR 1.1 billion on May 25, 2026. A cash consideration valued at INR 353 per share will be paid by Geetanjali Trading And Investments Private Limited.\r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to approval by regulatory board / committee, minimum tender, approval of merger agreement by target board, approval of offer by acquirer board and approval of offer by target shareholders. The deal has been approved by the acquirer board.\r\n\r\nKreo Capital Private Limited acted as financial advisor for Geetanjali Trading And Investments Private Limited.",
